{
  "winner": "tie",
  "evidence": "Both accurately convey that similar numbers of patients in the two dose groups had low vitamin D levels and that the 5,600 IU group had greater increases over 24 weeks. For “greater increases in vitamin D levels over the 24 weeks,” A’s “mayores aumentos de los niveles de vitamina D durante las 24 semanas” and B’s “mayores aumentos de las concentraciones de vitamina D a lo largo de las 24 semanas” are equivalent."
}
